    "expect is the verdict at verify_at for HOGLAKE_AUTH_SESSION_PROFILE=on and otherwise the same configuration as contract-vectors.json (issuer, audience hoglake, predicate field team_id, rtg backends configured as hoglite).",
    "Every vector is a mutation today: a client input minted as the main file mints it, then the profile's claims added. No issuer mints the profile yet; an issuer's suite skips mutations.",
    "aws.* values are fictional. hoglake never uses them, never logs them, and never echoes them in a refusal; it checks presence, type and that exp <= aws.expires_at (<= session_deadline).",
    "ES256 signatures are randomised: re-minting gives the same header and claims segments, a different signature."
